# Sterling Supplier with no other creature of its controller's: "another target creature you control" has no legal target, so the
# trigger is removed from the stack (CR 603.3d) and nothing gets a counter - not the Supplier, not Bot2's Ornithopter (control: the
# first scenario shows the counter when another creature of Bot1's is there).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Sterling Supplier
Plains x3
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sterling Supplier.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
